# === Egress CT111 + CT112 (neanelu) -- ADITIVE pe hz.247 ===
# Scop: permite CT111/CT112 sa faca egress strict (80/443 + DNS) catre internet.
#
# Aplicare (manual, pe hz.247):
# - adauga liniile in `/etc/iptables.rules` (dupa regulile existente ale altor CT-uri)
# - apoi: `iptables-restore < /etc/iptables.rules`
#
# Nota:
# - Interfata WAN (outbound) este presupusa `enp98s0f0` (conform audit). Daca difera, inlocuieste in ambele tabele.

*nat
-A POSTROUTING -s 10.0.1.111/32 -o enp98s0f0 -p tcp -m multiport --dports 80,443 -j MASQUERADE
-A POSTROUTING -s 10.0.1.111/32 -o enp98s0f0 -p udp -m udp --dport 53 -j MASQUERADE
-A POSTROUTING -s 10.0.1.111/32 -o enp98s0f0 -p tcp -m tcp --dport 53 -j MASQUERADE

-A POSTROUTING -s 10.0.1.112/32 -o enp98s0f0 -p tcp -m multiport --dports 80,443 -j MASQUERADE
-A POSTROUTING -s 10.0.1.112/32 -o enp98s0f0 -p udp -m udp --dport 53 -j MASQUERADE
-A POSTROUTING -s 10.0.1.112/32 -o enp98s0f0 -p tcp -m tcp --dport 53 -j MASQUERADE
COMMIT

*filter
-A FORWARD -s 10.0.1.111/32 -o enp98s0f0 -p tcp -m multiport --dports 80,443 -j ACCEPT
-A FORWARD -s 10.0.1.111/32 -o enp98s0f0 -p udp -m udp --dport 53 -j ACCEPT
-A FORWARD -s 10.0.1.111/32 -o enp98s0f0 -p tcp -m tcp --dport 53 -j ACCEPT
-A FORWARD -s 10.0.1.111/32 -o enp98s0f0 -m state --state RELATED,ESTABLISHED -j ACCEPT
-A FORWARD -d 10.0.1.111/32 -i enp98s0f0 -m state --state RELATED,ESTABLISHED -j ACCEPT
-A FORWARD -s 10.0.1.111/32 -o enp98s0f0 -j DROP

-A FORWARD -s 10.0.1.112/32 -o enp98s0f0 -p tcp -m multiport --dports 80,443 -j ACCEPT
-A FORWARD -s 10.0.1.112/32 -o enp98s0f0 -p udp -m udp --dport 53 -j ACCEPT
-A FORWARD -s 10.0.1.112/32 -o enp98s0f0 -p tcp -m tcp --dport 53 -j ACCEPT
-A FORWARD -s 10.0.1.112/32 -o enp98s0f0 -m state --state RELATED,ESTABLISHED -j ACCEPT
-A FORWARD -d 10.0.1.112/32 -i enp98s0f0 -m state --state RELATED,ESTABLISHED -j ACCEPT
-A FORWARD -s 10.0.1.112/32 -o enp98s0f0 -j DROP
COMMIT

